#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignored file formats:

# Media:
*.pdf
*.png
*.ppm
*.sfz
*.wav

# Build products:
*.app
*.component
*.dll
*.exe
*.lib
*.so

# Build intermediates (C++):
*.o
*.obj

# Build intermediates (LaTeX):
*.aux
*.auxlock
*.bbl
*.figlist
*.log
*.md5
*.out
*.toc

# IDE generated (by Visual Studio):
*.exp
*.idb
*.ilk
*.ipch
*.lastbuildstate
*.layout
*.opendb
*.opensdf
*.pdb
*.res
*.sdf
*.suo
*.tlog
*.user

# IDE generated (by XCode):
*.xcworkspacedata
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscheme
*.xcsettings
*.xcbkptlist

# Preview acceleration:
*.db
*.DS_Store
*.pk

# Misc/Unknown:
*.blg
*.layout
*.7z

# Temporary 
*.synctex(busy)
# These files appear only during (LaTeX?) builds and are automatically deleted when the build is 
# finished. When comitting during a build phase they might get accidently added which we want to 
# avoid.


